            desc = "Column address for the memory that is read or written by the software configuration module The DDRC access address must be aligned based on the current DMC bit width. For example, if the current DMC bit width is 128 bits: When the 64-/72-bit external DDR is connected, the DMC addresses are accessed based on {sfc_col[15:1], 1'b0}. When the 32-/36-bit external DDR is connected, the DMC addresses are accessed based on {sfc_col[15:2]0.2'b0}.";
            sw = rw; hw = r;
