- 0: continuous trigger mode. The performance counter continues to count. This ensures no overflow within 1s in continuous count mode.
- 1: single trigger mode. When the performance statistics time reaches perf_prd, the count value is retained and counting stops.

The maximum statistical result retains after an overflow occurs.";
